msgid ""
"Declaring objects as `const` is an important tool of enforcing mutation free "
"algorithms (such as analyses, etc.).  For this purpose above iterators come "
"in constant flavors as `Value::const_use_iterator` and `Value::"
"const_op_iterator`.  They automatically arise when calling `use/op_begin()` "
"on `const Value*`s or `const User*`s respectively. Upon dereferencing, they "
"return `const Use*`s.  Otherwise the above patterns remain unchanged."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2753
msgid "Iterating over predecessors & successors of blocks"
msgstr ""

