#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2771
msgid "Making simple changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2773
msgid ""
"There are some primitive transformation operations present in the LLVM "
"infrastructure that are worth knowing about.  When performing "
"transformations, it's fairly common to manipulate the contents of basic "
"blocks.  This section describes some of the common methods for doing so and "
"gives example code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2780
msgid "Creating and inserting new `Instruction`s"
msgstr ""

