msgid ""
"Creation of `Instruction`s is straightforward: simply call the constructor "
"for the kind of instruction to instantiate and provide the necessary "
"parameters. For example, an `AllocaInst` only *requires* a (const-ptr-to) "
"`Type`.  Thus:"
