#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2890 ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2916
msgid "Deleting Instructions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2892
msgid ""
"Deleting an instruction from an existing sequence of instructions that form "
"a `BasicBlock` is very straightforward: just call the instruction's "
"`eraseFromParent()` method.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2900
msgid ""
"This unlinks the instruction from its containing basic block and deletes "
"it.  If you'd just like to unlink the instruction from its containing basic "
"block but not delete it, you can use the `removeFromParent()` method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2906
msgid "Replacing an Instruction with another Value"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:2908
msgid "Replacing individual instructions"
