"`Value::use_iterator` - Typedef for iterator over the use-list\\ `Value::"
"const_use_iterator` - Typedef for const_iterator over the   use-list\\ "
"`unsigned use_size()` - Returns the number of users of the value.\\ `bool "
"use_empty()` - Returns true if there are no users.\\ `use_iterator "
"use_begin()` - Get an iterator to the start of the   use-list.\\ "
"`use_iterator use_end()` - Get an iterator to the end of the use-list.\\ "
"`User *use_back()` - Returns the last element in the list."
