"Returns the {ref}`BasicBlock <BasicBlock>` that this `Instruction` is "
"embedded into."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:3608
msgid "`bool mayWriteToMemory()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ProgrammersManual.md:3610
msgid ""
"Returns true if the instruction writes to memory, i.e., it is a `call`, "
"`free`, `invoke`, or `store`."
msgstr ""

